# emptyos-codoc — environment. Copy to .env before `bash scripts/deploy-service.sh emptyos-codoc`.
#
# This service authenticates by trusted hop (the control-plane proxy injects
# X-EOS-Principal); it holds no secrets of its own. The only knob is the SQLite
# path, which the compose file already sets to the mounted volume — so an empty
# .env is valid. Override only if you want a different DB location.

# CODOC_DB=/app/data/codoc.db
